## ✅ CustomerEmailEscalation — Flow Complete

**File:** `CustomerEmailEscalation/CustomerEmailEscalation/CustomerEmailEscalation.flow`

### What the flow does

```
Email Received (Outlook webhook)
    ↓
Classify Email [AI Agent] — reads subject + body, outputs "urgent" or "normal"
    ↓ (success)                  ↓ (error)
Is Urgent? [Decision]          Done (Error)
    ↓ Urgent            ↓ Normal
Notify Slack        Create Support Ticket [mock placeholder]
    ↓                   ↓
Reply to Customer   Reply to Customer
(urgent message)    (ticket info message)
    ↓                   ↓
Done (Urgent)       Done (Normal)
```

### What each piece does
| Node | What it does |
|---|---|
| **Email Received** | Webhook trigger — fires instantly when email hits your inbox |
| **Classify Email** | AI agent reads the subject + body, decides urgent vs normal |
| **Is Urgent?** | Routes to the right branch |
| **Notify Slack** | Posts an alert to your team's Slack channel |
| **Reply to Customer (urgent)** | Sends "we're on it" reply immediately |
| **Create Support Ticket** | ⚠️ Mock placeholder — needs a real ticketing system later |
| **Reply to Customer (normal)** | Sends reply with ticket reference |

